                            (Super-heavy Walker, Character)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="b31a-e1d7-e57b-8cd7" name="The Forgotten Knight" hidden="false">
          <description>Gerantius's ion shield confers a 3+ invulnerable save instead of
                        the normal 4+. He cannot have a Warlord trait, and does not use the rules
                        for Knightly Ranks.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0da2-3928-cd23-2eab" name="Striker" hidden="false">
          <description>Gerantius can shoot in the same turn that he runs (he cannot run
                        and charge). In addition he must re-roll results of "1" on the Stomp table.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
